    "title": "Ex-Cuyahoga County Prosecutor Carl Sullivan Indicted on Obstruction Charges, Jailed - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chad Bradshaw ,\n12 hours ago Cuyahoga County Common Pleas Court — Reported Arraignment Location. A former Cuyahoga County assistant prosecutor is sitting in the Cuyahoga County jail after being indicted on two felony counts of obstructing justice. Carl Sullivan was charged Tuesday, and the case has already been handed off to prosecutors from a neighboring county to avoid any appearance of impropriety. Read full article\n1",
